1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,587
I've been working on this exhibition for three weeks.

2
00:00:03,537 --> 00:00:07,207
At first, I kept putting off the difficult jobs.

3
00:00:07,207 --> 00:00:10,837
Then I decided to set one small goal each morning.

4
00:00:10,837 --> 00:00:15,824
I've been leaving my phone in another room since Monday, and it really helps.

5
00:00:15,824 --> 00:00:21,117
I've finished six labels today, but I haven't finished the whole exhibition yet.

6
00:00:21,117 --> 00:00:25,106
I'm also trying to give up checking messages during lunch.

7
00:00:25,106 --> 00:00:28,404
It isn't easy, but I'm sticking to my plan.

